  <div class="content-faq">
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>What is the best code right now</h3>
      <p><strong>HELLOSAILY</strong>: 15% off all Saily plans, storewide.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Is Saily's unlimited data really unlimited</h3>
      <p>For normal use, yes. Saily's own fair-use policy gives full speed up to 5GB in a rolling 24-hour window in most destinations (3GB in some), then throttles to 1Mbps until the local-midnight reset.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>What is Saily Ultra</h3>
      <p>A $59.99/month subscription tier: 30GB of high-speed data across 121+ destinations (then unlimited at 1Mbps), the full NordVPN/NordPass/NordLayer/Incogni suite, 8% cashback in Saily credit, and a monthly airport lounge pass plus fast-track pass that roll over for up to three months.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Does Saily work in Turkey</h3>
      <p>Saily's website and app were among those blocked by Turkey's telecom regulator starting mid-2025. Buy and install the eSIM before you land: it keeps working once active, but you can't purchase or top up while physically inside Turkey.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>What is Saily's refund policy</h3>
      <p>A full refund if the eSIM was never installed or activated, within 30 days of purchase. You may also qualify if you've used less than 1% of your data or had a genuine service-quality issue. Saily runs an auto-refund center that handles eligible cases without a support ticket.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Can I use hotspot on Saily</h3>
      <p>Yes, tethering is supported on Saily data plans; enable mobile hotspot in your phone's settings as you would with a physical SIM.</p>
    </div>
